.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-listen 1  "listen " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-listen \- Watch for matching tags and branches being created
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora listen\fR [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-branch\fR] [\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-target\fR] [\fB\-\-attempt\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-topic\fR] [\fB\-\-existing\fR] [\fB\-\-once\fR] [\fB\-\-poll\-interval\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIcommand\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Watch for matching tags and branches being created
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
Ordinary tag name pattern, e.g. \*(Aqpending/main/*\*(Aq
.TP
\fB\-\-branch\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
Ordinary branch name pattern, e.g. \*(Aqagent/alice/*\*(Aq
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\-id\fR \fI<id>\fR
Parsed agent, or the current branch association for a tag
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fI<name>\fR
Target encoded in a workflow name
.TP
\fB\-\-attempt\-id\fR \fI<id>\fR
Attempt encoded in a workflow name
.TP
\fB\-\-topic\fR \fI<id>\fR
Direct topic membership of the pointed\-to commit
.TP
\fB\-\-existing\fR
First emit current matches (labeled \*(Aqexisting\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-\-once\fR
Exit after the first match is emitted or its callback succeeds
.TP
\fB\-\-poll\-interval\fR \fI<d>\fR [default: 1s]
Observation interval
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIcommand\fR]
Command invoked once per match with the JSON line on stdin
